 to dress up as Napoleon  Dynamite while Camilla Mendes dressed up  as his partner in crime Pedro  so did the girls pull off this look  whose group Halloween costumes did you  like best  Archie Charles Andrews or lily and  Camilla's let us know in the comments  section but first let's enjoy a  behind-the-scenes moment of Lily  channeling Napoleon's epic dance moves  now that was something it's easy to see  that the entire Riverdale cast has a  special sense of humor some would even  say there are adorkable but when it  comes to posting hilarious pictures Cole  Sprouse comes out on top  Cole posted a jaw-dropping Instagram  picture that had fans grinning from ear  to ear fans were in disbelief over  Ronald's photoshop skills especially  since he swapped out Camilla's face for  Cole's instead of Archie's Riverdale is  such a serious TV series that it's easy  to forget these actors share plenty of  laughs behind the camera the Riverdale  cast has quickly become a family and  Families love to joke around pick on  each other and celebrate important  moments in each other's lives so an  actor Jordan Connor who's known for  playing sweet pea got engaged to his  longtime girlfriend Jen Jarrah Mitchell  the Riverdale cast just had to celebrate  you're engaged  actress Madeleine pets who plays Sheryl  blossom posted this sweet moment on  snapchat we can see actors Vanessa  Morgan and Skeet Ulrich who played Tony  topaz and FJ Jones respectively hanging  out in the background it's not every day  that the gang gets to celebrate an  engagement but birthdays are plentiful  this time it was Madeline's turned to be  in the front of the camera the cast  circled around Madeline to sing her  happy birthday she's wearing a tiny  little crown and looked super happy to  be celebrating her Riverdale family KJ  was filming this tender moment and he  ended the video by goofing around with  the girl next door Betty Cooper have you  ever wondered what the Southside  Serpent's do when no one's watching well  so have we so we did a little digging  and found out that serpents like Tony  and fangs like to rock out with their  snapchat filters out behind the scenes  in real life Anessa Morgan and drew ray  Tanner have very different styles so  whenever they throw on their leather  jackets they let their inner rockers  come out now you would think that the ex  serpent leader fp' Jones would be  rocking out alongside them but actor  Skeet Ulrich seems to prefer the  classics over death metal in this  behind-the-scenes moment we see skeet  driving Charles Melton and dylan sprouse  to an unknown destination  Charles is chewing a piece of gum in the  backseat tricking skeet into thinking  that he's singing along to the music but  wait what is still in Sprouse doing with  the Riverdale cast what happened to Cole  it looks like Effie Jones inherently  adopted his on-screen son's twin brother  it feels like only yesterday that Disney  Channel stars cole and dylan sprouse  were causing mischief on the beloved TV  series The Suite Life of Zack and Cody  the Sprouse twins were inseparable for  most of their lives so many Riverdale  fans were shocked when Cole was cast as  Jughead Jones leaving Dillon to his own  devices so we're not too surprised to  find out that Dillon comes to hang out  with the Riverdale cast whenever the  opportunity arises seeing the Sprouse  twins side-by-side might have been what  caused Lilly Reinhardt and Camilla  Mendes to burst into song behind the  scenes  [Music]  in this video we see Lily and Camilla  laying down next to each other while  belting out the sweet life theme song  yep sounds like they pretty much nailed  it  we bet Lily never once thought she'd end  up dating Cody Martin while binge  watching the hilarious Disney Channel  series The CW's Riverdale is a huge  success  so it comes as no surprise that the cast  is constantly traveling to new  destinations to film interviews or  attend events the Riverdale cast knows a  thing or two about photoshoots as well  and they always put their best faces on  every single character and actor brings  something new to the table still it's  hard to take our eyes off the show's  leading ladies and they know it too  Camila Mendez posted this adorable  picture of Lily Madeline and herself  attending a glamorous event and soon  after she uploaded this scandalous video  to her Instagram page these leading  ladies are on fire and their outfits are  drop-dead gorgeous  which leading lady is your favorite  Veronica Betty Sheryl or Josie the  Riverdale cast spends a lot of time at  pops chocolate shop so we're not  surprised that they've become super  chummy with the one and only pop Tate  who is portrayed by actor Alvin Sanders  here's an adorable behind-the-scenes  selfie which was captured by cole  sprouse and posted by camilla mendes pop  Tate has made the gang hundreds of  Milkshakes over the years which is  probably why Jimmy Fallon wanted to  share a milkshake with the cast while on  the set of The Tonight Show Starring  Jimmy Fallon the leading actors joined  forces to guzzle down a chocolate  milkshake and Jimmy Fallon totally  snagged jugheads classic hat if there's  one thing Riverdale fans look forward to  every year it's Comic Con and the same  can be said about the cast they love to  meet their fans which is why they can't  wait to attend this yearly event the  show's leading actors played a game of  truth or dare at the 2018 Comic Con  event which was hosted by E news they  took turns asking each other questions  or giving each other dares and the  outcome was hilarious  in this clip we see KJ mocking his  on-screen rival Hyrum Lodge who is  played by actor Mark Consuelos mark  doesn't seem to mind the shade though  but the look on Ashleigh Murray's face  says it all by the look of things mark  can be a little uptight from time to  time but it's safe to say that most of  the time it's all in act so what if KJ  made fun of mark at Comic Con it looks  like these two co-stars have a hilarious  love-hate relationship going on behind  the scenes  besides mark is usually the one throwing  shade at KJ a lot of Riverdale fans were  bummed when Jesse broke things off with  Archie because while they're so good  together they were all support and no  dramas so it's nice to know that KJ and  Ashley's bond didn't take a major hit  off screen in fact these buds clearly  have a lot of love and respect for each  other during the same truth-or-dare  segment ashley confirmed what most of us  already knew she and KJ are two peas in  a pod if you had to be stuck on an  island with only one co-star who would  it be  KJ did you see how quickly Ashley  answered that question it's almost as if  she thought of being stranded on an  island with KJ before mmm interesting we  loved their relationship and couldn't  imagine anyone else billing Ashley's  shoes unfortunately the amazing singer  is setting her sights on another  production but more on that later it's  no secret that the Riverdale cast has  had fun on and off the set but that  doesn't mean that they're not working  hard  both Hyrum and RG are tough guys who  have stellar physiques so it makes total  sense that they work out together behind  the scenes some might even say that KJ  and Mark Consuelos have a budding  bromance KJ posted this clip on snapchat  while encouraging mark to keep at it who  would have thought that Archie and  Hiram's were such good pals in real life  hectic filming schedules and public  appearances can take up a lot of time  which is why working actors have little  downtime so it's only normal to want to  catch up on some much-needed rest when  the right moment comes along and thanks  to KJ we now know that mark can fall  asleep pretty much anywhere who knew  being the kingpin of Riverdale could be  so exhausting taking videos of your  friends when they're asleep isn't  exactly a nice thing to do so we're  happy to see Cole Sprouse avenged mark  behind the scenes  judgin Cole scared the  us out of cage a but that's what you get  for filming your co-stars in their most  vulnerable hour unfortunately for the  Riverdale cast it seems like being  filmed while asleep is a trend of some  sorts just look at actor casey kaat who  plays kevin keller taking a  well-deserved nap on the couch but this  time it wasn't KJ who was filming his  co-stars it was Marisol Nichols who  portrays Hermione Lodge on the show the  actress filmed co-stars Casey cot  Vanessa Morgan and machen amick after a  long and exhausting red-eye flight now  that's some risky business but hey  Hermione Lodge is known to take risks  every now and then  as previously mentioned actress Ashley  Marie is leaving Riverdale to reprise  her current role in the upcoming TV  series Katy keen this new TV show will  allow Ashley to showcase her exceptional  singing abilities while taking on a more  essential role it's no secret that  Ashley loves to perform it's what she  was made to do although we're sad to see  her go Josie's talents are wasted on the  little town of Riverdale so we're happy  to hear that she'll be pursuing her  passions on the set of Katy keen the  Riverdale cast is super happy for her  but some co-stars are still in denial  out with the old and in with the new  that's what Ashley is all about it's all  news that the Riverdale cast have formed  unbreakable bonds with each other and we  can't wait to see what they have in  store for us so which one of these  behind-the-scenes moments was your  favorite let us know in the comments  section below and while you're at it  tell us which Riverdale couple is your  all-time favorite we're totally shipping  bug-head and that's the end of our video  for more like this be sure to subscribe  to the things and as usual leave a like  and comment thanks for watching we'll  catch you next time  [Music]

